Product Name

Phoenix Adventures – Trekking & Tour Booking Platform

🎯 Objective

Build a secure, scalable full-stack web application that:

Allows users to browse & book trekking/tour activities

Allows admins to manage activities, bookings, blogs, and users

Supports secure online payments

Provides analytics & reporting

👥 User Roles
1️⃣ User (Customer)

Register / Login

Browse activities

Filter by location, difficulty, price

View activity details

Add to cart

Checkout & pay

View booking history

Cancel bookings

Write reviews

Read blogs

2️⃣ Admin

Secure login (2FA enabled)

Add/Edit/Delete activities

Upload images

Manage bookings

View active users

Manage blogs

Refund processing

Dashboard analytics (Revenue, bookings, users)

🧩 Core Features
🔹 Activity Module

Title

Description

Images

Location

Duration

Difficulty Level

Price

Available Dates

Slots Available

🔹 Booking Module

Cart system

Order confirmation

Payment integration

Booking status tracking

🔹 Blog Module

Admin creates blogs

SEO friendly URLs

🔹 Analytics Dashboard

Total revenue

Monthly bookings

Active users

Top activities

🚀 Non-Functional Requirements

Secure authentication (JWT + Refresh tokens)

SSL enabled

Responsive design

99% uptime

Payment PCI compliant

Scalable architecture